{"about_the_game":"Short Description<br />\r\nMatch the colored element indicator and the attack direction to defeat enemies before the timer runs out. Quick restarts, rising scores, mastery!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout the Game<br />\r\nOne Hit Wizard is a fast one-hit action game that rewards quick reading of visual cues. The colored indicator next to the enemy shows the effective element; bright glows on the enemy\u2019s edges show where to strike. If there\u2019s no glow, attack from Low. Some specials (e.g., Goblin King) ignore elements\u2014just hit the required direction. Quick Restart keeps runs snappy; best score is saved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHighlights<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEasy to read, hard to master.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFour elements with simple counters: Water &gt; Fire; Shock &gt; Water; Fire &gt; Leaf; Leaf &gt; Shock.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInstant action: Quick Restart, clean UI, persistent best score.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecial encounters like the Goblin King.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMulti-language UI.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to Play (Short)<br />\r\nGoal: win before the timer.<br />\r\nRead element via the colored indicator; read direction via the edge glows (no glow \u2192 Low). Use the counter element for a one-hit kill.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRoadmap (Coming Soon)<br />\r\n\u2022 Animation improvements <br />\r\n\u2022 Enemy variety <br />\r\n\u2022 Character customization <br />\r\n\u2022 Boss fights &amp; rewards <br />\r\n\u2022 Optional parry <br />\r\n\u2022 Multiplayer: PvP &amp; PvE","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rise my firend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950540/795b245ba424c1c7b723aa304ef6f7e8849f0eba.jpg"},{"name":"20!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950540/a074fdfbc69f2923478c57f4faf46d08d478736b.jpg"},{"name":"BURRRRNNNN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950540/9718b1278e46defdcd294409d0759547602960f4.jp